<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Q1 industrial production falls 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss Q1 industrial production falls 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss industrial production fell 8.1 percent in the first quarter from the fourth quarter of 1996 for a 0.8 percent year-on-year decline, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				 Q1 1997   Q4 1996  Q1 1996</p>
<p> Pct yr/yr change	  -0.8	+3.0     +2.0</p>
<p> Index (mid 1995=100)    97.5	106.1    98.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The office said the figures mainly showed a seasonal fluctuation in production.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
